PAUSED — video generation is switched OFF until ElevenLabs is funded again.

Why: the ElevenLabs subscription lapsed (not renewed), and every rendered video
spends ElevenLabs credits. While this file exists at the repo root, the whole
pipeline refuses to render, so no credits are spent and no story is consumed.

Honoured in BOTH places, from this one file:
  * CI     — .github/workflows/generate_video.yml and performance.yml skip their
             jobs (this is what the "pause-check" job reads).
  * LOCAL  — tasks.py, main.py, voiceover.py and narrate_story.py refuse to
             render (config.py reads this same file).

TO RESUME (once the subscription is paid):
  * Local:  delete this file, or run `python -c "import os;os.remove('AUTOMATION_PAUSED')"`
            from faceless-video-platform/.
  * CI:     delete this file in the GitHub repo (repo root -> AUTOMATION_PAUSED
            -> trash icon -> commit). The next scheduled run then renders as normal.
  * One-off override without deleting the file: set AUTOMATION_PAUSED=false in
    the environment (e.g. `AUTOMATION_PAUSED=false python narrate_story.py ...`).

Paused on: 2026-10-02 (ElevenLabs subscription ended).
